    "displayName": "Orison Relief: Large Fabrication Order",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Alright,\n\nThe damage reports are still rolling in from the Nine Tails' attack on Orison and the folks at Crusader are saying they might have to repair a significant proportion of the propulsors on those platforms. That's why this one's a massive order.\n\nLarger quantity, but same as before otherwise. Either manufacturer them yourself using an Item Fabricator or source them some other way.\n\nWhen you're done, drop the propulsors off at [Destination]. Be a big payout with this one.\n\nTa very much,\nHal Grimsby\nContracts Manager\n\nCORNERSTONE MAINTENANCE\n\"Building on the Foundations of our Past.\"",
